{"schema_version":1,"dataset_id":"metro-coverage-stops","country":"LK","source_ids":["metro-coverage","lk-metro","osm-walk-colombo","lk-census-2024","gig-data-gnd-boundaries","osm","overture-places"],"vintage":"Walk graph 2026-10 · Census 2024 · CM stops 2026-08 · Overture 2026-09-23.1","title":"Metro Bus stop walking coverage","description":"Residents within a 5- and 10-minute walk of each Colombo Metro Bus stop, compared with the 800 m circle.","grain":"One row per Colombo Metro Bus (CM) stop.","notes":["Derived by developing-country.org with scripts/build-metro-coverage.mjs from lk_metro stops and lines (MIT), the OpenStreetMap walking network (ODbL), Census 2024 GN-division population (Department of Census and Statistics via nuuuwan/lk_census_2024) and GN boundaries from nuuuwan/gig-data (MIT).","Walking speed 80 m/min: 5 minutes = 400 m and 10 minutes = 800 m of walking along the OSM street and path network, starting from the stop snapped to its nearest street.","A walkshed is every reached street segment buffered 50 m either side (the plot frontage a pedestrian reaches) and unioned; the comparison is an 800 m straight-line circle around each stop.","Population inside a walkshed is the area-weighted share of each GN division inside it times the division population, computed on a 5 m equal-area raster; unions never double count overlapping stops.","Offices and other businesses are Overture Maps Places release 2026-09-23.1 listings (CDLA-Permissive-2.0) with confidence ≥ 0.5 and not closed, counted when their network walk to a stop is within the time band. Businesses exclude offices, geographic entities, cultural and historic sites, places of worship and uncategorised listings.","Stop populations and facility counts overlap where walksheds overlap, so their fields are not summable (aggregation none); use metro-coverage-lines (ALL row) for unique totals, metro-coverage-gnd to sum residents and metro-coverage-facilities to sum facilities."],"caveats":["Assumes people are spread uniformly within each GN division; real homes cluster along roads, so walkshed population is probably understated and circle population overstated.","Residential (census night-time) population only: workers, students and visitors in Colombo during the day are not counted.","OSM path completeness varies: missing lanes and private short-cuts shrink walksheds; mapped paths that are gated or unsafe enlarge them. Slope, crossings and footpath quality are ignored.","Stop locations are as compiled by nuuuwan/lk_metro and may differ from the kerbside stops in operation.","Office and business counts are Overture listings, not jobs: no headcount or floor area, uneven coverage, and only listings with confidence ≥ 0.5."],"primary_key":["stop_id"],"fields":[{"id":"stop_id","role":"dimension","type":"string","label":"Stop ID"},{"id":"stop","role":"dimension","type":"string","label":"Stop"},{"id":"routes","role":"dimension","type":"string","label":"CM routes"},{"id":"route_count","role":"measure","type":"integer","label":"Routes serving the stop","unit":"routes","aggregation":"none"},{"id":"lng","role":"dimension","type":"number","label":"Longitude","unit":"degrees"},{"id":"lat","role":"dimension","type":"number","label":"Latitude","unit":"degrees"},{"id":"snap_m","role":"measure","type":"number","label":"Distance from stop to nearest mapped street","unit":"m","aggregation":"none"},{"id":"pop_5min","role":"measure","type":"integer","label":"Residents within a 5-minute walk","unit":"people","aggregation":"none"},{"id":"pop_10min","role":"measure","type":"integer","label":"Residents within a 10-minute walk","unit":"people","aggregation":"none"},{"id":"pop_circle_800m","role":"measure","type":"integer","label":"Residents within 800 m straight line","unit":"people","aggregation":"none"},{"id":"circle_overstatement_pct","role":"measure","type":"number","label":"Circle overstatement versus 10-minute walk","unit":"%","aggregation":"none"},{"id":"walkshed_km2_5min","role":"m